WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.869
Let's reduce the module to five ideas First separate
dataset

00:00:05.895 --> 00:00:11.915
organization from variable meaning and technical
storage Second assess

00:00:11.928 --> 00:00:17.580
quality before trusting the analysis Third use
measurement scale

00:00:17.606 --> 00:00:23.288
to decide which comparisons and summaries make sense
Fourth remember

00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:29.050
that a dtype does not define analytical meaning
Fifth make preprocessing

00:00:29.076 --> 00:00:32.155
choices deliberately and document why they are
appropriate
